            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Cove 0.1.67</title></head><body><h1>Ask Cove reads attachments</h1><ul><li>Ask Cove about an open email and it now reads its PDF and text attachments too: “what are the amounts and capture lines in the PDFs?” gets the exact figures, cited to the email.</li><li>Follow-up questions use the same files without downloading them again. Scanned documents with no text are reported, never guessed.</li><li>The file text goes to your chosen writing model only when you ask about that email.</li></ul></body></html>
]]></description>
