            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Cove 0.1.66</title></head><body><h1>Attach files</h1><ul><li>Attach files to new emails and replies with the paperclip beside Send, or drop them anywhere on a draft.</li><li>While you’re writing a reply, drop files anywhere on the window to attach them; with nothing open, dropping files starts a new email with them.</li><li>Files are kept with the draft on this Mac, encrypted, until the email is sent, so Undo and restarts don’t lose them. Gmail allows 25 MB per email.</li></ul></body></html>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://covemail.xyz/downloads/Cove-0.1.66.dmg" length="24503888" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="2w6hW6M6yrwraw/8BczQyT5uBqgVdrjT3fLXJQdPM1kIvkv4x8S17y36Sn1mMQz9HvUS6b8Cm2fFygCClEFKCQ=="/>
