            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Cove 0.1.65</title></head><body><h1>About you, on all your devices</h1><ul><li>About you can now sync between Cove on your Mac, iPhone and iPad. Turn on “Sync with your iPhone and iPad” in Agent → About you; it’s off until you do, and the newest edit wins.</li><li>It doesn’t need cloud mail sync and sends no email. About you is stored encrypted on Cove’s server, which can decrypt it, and you can remove the server copy at any time.</li></ul></body></html>
]]></description>
